83: \textbf{Problem:} Kubernetes heals container crashes but is \alert{blind to network-layer failures}.
84: 
85: \begin{itemize}
86:   \item CNI plugin crashes $\to$ pods stuck in \texttt{ContainerCreating}
87:   \item CoreDNS degradation $\to$ silent DNS resolution failures
