97:   \item \textbf{CNI plugin health} (Calico IPAM exhaustion \& agent failures)
98:   \item \textbf{CoreDNS availability} (scale-to-zero, corrupted upstreams, latency spikes)
99:   \item \textbf{Pod-to-pod connectivity} (overlay tunnel drops \& cross-node routing)
100: \end{enumerate}
